{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06等段的感受提示比较密集，纵向交替阅读时，快速抓住叙事主线不如Y左右分栏轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用关键词放大加亮，让每段的核心意思更容易抓住，而感受提示按音乐进程出现，能把情绪变化和具体音乐时刻联系起来，尤其在细腻程度和情绪转折上明显更丰富。Y的左右分栏和完整叙述更容易快速跟住故事主线，整体阅读也更顺畅，但右侧感受词较多地同时呈现，缺少X那种随音乐逐步展开的体验。综合而言，我选X，因为它不仅讲清了人物的心理变化，还让人更具体地感受到这些变化是怎样发生的。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6eaa641e-4522-4e89-9c18-1e4f854f96dc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001041105881Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:11:53.029870+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a5e9de643b8ea72d40bc1cf4de7bac896471239bc52001b2ef27b8594dc7e37", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp